        "raw": "<p>Each hit is a separate instance of damage - each time Akash&#39;Bhuta tries to hit a hero, Visionary can choose whether or not to redirect that damage. If she chooses to redirect the lot, you&#39;d do the effects of Wrest the Mind for every hit - one per hero. So Visionary would have to hit herself for each redirected hit.</p><p>Any time multiple targets are being hit by the same attack, each hit is considered a separate instance of damage. Similarly, if a single attack deals two hits (for example, Fanatic&#39;s base power, Exorcism), they&#39;re considered two separate instances of damage (even if they both have to hit the same target) and so are both treated separate in terms of buffs/soak.</p>",
