      {
        "id": 65275,
        "name": "Foote",
        "username": "Foote",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-06-05T20:30:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Scott Brownlee\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Scott Brownlee:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Did we play this correctly</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Well the long and short of it is no since Wrest the Mind can't be played on character cards.</p>\n<p>But <em>generally</em>, you would treat each instance of damage separatly. Visionary would indeed take 2 (should be 3) damage for each redirect. With 4 heros, thats 4 instances that you redirected, so Visionary would end up taking 8 (should be 12) in that case.</p>",
        "post_number": 3,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:42:39.730Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
