        "raw": "[quote=\"Scott Brownlee\"]\n\nDid we play this correctly\n\n[/quote]\n\nWell the long and short of it is no since Wrest the Mind can&#39;t be played on character cards.\n\nBut <em>generally</em>, you would treat each instance of damage separatly. Visionary would indeed take 2 (should be 3) damage for each redirect. With 4 heros, thats 4 instances that you redirected, so Visionary would end up taking 8 (should be 12) in that case.\n",
